# Maintainer ownership for the tealstreet-sdk mirror.
#
# The load-bearing control is branch protection (only maintainers can merge to
# the default branch). This file adds review-required ownership on top, and —
# critically — locks the CI and root tooling so outside contributors cannot
# alter how the mirror builds or what runs in CI.
#
# Owned by the @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers org team (granted push on this
# mirror). Outside contributors are not members, so their reviews never
# satisfy code-owner review.

# Everything requires a maintainer review by default.
*                       @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers

# CI, root tooling, and ownership itself — maintainers only, no exceptions.
/.github/               @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/CODEOWNERS             @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/LICENSE                @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/yarn.lock              @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/package.json           @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/turbo.json             @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/tsconfig.base.json     @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/eslint.config.mjs      @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
/eslint.config.frontend.mjs @Tealstreet/mirror-maintainers
